WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
- Pretend like you're breathing out like,

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.810
(breathing out) but with
your teeth touching.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.360
- Should I bite my lip?

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:06.803
- Yeah (laughing)

00:00:06.803 --> 00:00:09.386
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.010
- Hi there, I'm Aria and
I've always been baffled

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:14.810
by the idea of an Instagram model.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.120
You know, the concept
of combining your looks

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.990
and harnessing the power of social media

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.680
to create a new and very
lucrative profession

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.433
is a bit astounding to me.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.493
Especially as someone who, if
you look at my Instagram page,

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:30.103
let's just say the word,
sexy may not come to mind.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.420
But that's why we're
here, we're here to learn

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.280
more about this unique profession

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.550
and perhaps some tips and tricks

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.633
along the way by spending the
day with an Instagram model.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.347
A car is coming by, heyoo.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.310
I'm meeting with Abigail Ratchford,

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.550
a former paralegal turned model

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.950
whose pictures began blowing up online

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.580
a few years ago and who can
now easily charge upwards

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:58.263
of several thousand
dollars per sponsored post.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.720
- So, I feel like now social media

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.710
is kind of just the currency of things.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.070
So, as where maybe five years
ago, a company would pay for a

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:08.610
billboard on Sunset Boulevard
that gets 10 million views

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.070
they're gonna pay a girl
with 10 million followers

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.400
to post an ad, so it's
kinda just like the more

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.413
followers you have, the
more money you can request.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:17.960
- What are the keys to a great selfie?

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:21.660
- Good lighting for sure, know
your angles, and eye contact.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.483
You like look down, then look up.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.457
One, two, three, now look up (laughing).

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:28.450
- How many followers
do you currently have?

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:31.910
- Instagram, I think is like, 8.3 million

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:33.403
or 8.2 million, I'm not sure.

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:35.413
- Good God.

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:38.400
- I mean to be completely
blunt, I think it's, you know,

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.040
the whole sex appeal
thing that got me here,

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.680
but then for me, at least,
I've kinda just used

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.570
my social media following

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.940
as a launching pad for bigger things.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.740
- [Aria] And one of those bigger things is

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:52.380
Instagive, an online
campaign Abigail has launched

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.030
where she finds people in need,

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.290
helping them with anything from a makeover

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:58.143
to paying their medical bills.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.730
And today Diana, a high school senior,

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:04.283
is being given one of those
makeovers for her prom tonight.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.790
- [Abigail] Is there
somebody named Diana here?

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.167
I heard you are the lucky prom winner.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.253
Here we have some flowers.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:19.100
- Instagive basically is kinda
just my way of giving back

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.600
to people because I feel like
I come from a small town,

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.060
I'm the fifth of seven kids,
and I've just been so lucky

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:26.900
and so blessed to be where
I am in this amount of time.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:30.180
So, I was just like, I need
some kind of way to use

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.323
my platform and use my spotlight for good.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.223
Oh my God, you look amazing.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:35.770
You do (laughing).

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.837
- [Aria] While Diana finishes
up her transformation,

00:02:38.837 --> 00:02:42.073
Abigail decides to assess my Instagram.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.610
- I mean, your stuff's
kind of all over the place.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.410
Like, this isn't you, your postings

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.945
of other people, other content.

00:02:47.945 --> 00:02:49.323
- The atrium right now, I told her

00:02:49.323 --> 00:02:50.930
she seems to be doing very well--

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:51.860
This looks pretty interesting.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.460
- Yeah, that was, I spent
the day at a porn company.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.200
Nicole Aniston, are you
familiar with her work?

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.333
- No, I'm not.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.120
I would give your Instagram,
on a scale of one to 10,

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.253
like, a 5.8 maybe.
- 5.8?

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.420
- It looks good, I like it, I like it.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.070
- You clearly don't, 5.8, I mean.

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:10.123
Abigail then takes me outside
for a quick crash course.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.730
- So, this is, like, called
the baby face filter.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.727
- The baby face filter, okay.
- Yeah.

00:03:12.727 --> 00:03:15.150
You look down and then as
soon as you look up, you snap.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:17.187
- So look down.
- So, like, one, two, three.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.450
- Whoa, whoa, that's not a good photo.

00:03:19.473 --> 00:03:22.041
- (laughing) Do it
again, that was not good.

00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:24.340
- [Aria] After giving up on
my poor selfie technique,

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.060
- Could you get one of those flowers?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.050
- [Aria] Abigail decides

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.250
to just get behind the camera herself.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.290
- Hold it a little bit closer to you,

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.400
like you're smelling it

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.123
and then, yeah, just
put your eyes up to me.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:36.117
One, two, go.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.633
I love it, this is gonna go viral.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.210
Maybe just bite your hand.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:43.103
- Is this gonna move my
Instagram up from a 5.8?

00:03:43.103 --> 00:03:45.673
- [Abigail] Yes, yes, nailed it.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.327
- [Aria] Diana's makeover is now complete

00:03:48.327 --> 00:03:49.950
to Abigail's delight.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.543
- Oh my God, you look amazing.

00:03:55.543 --> 00:03:58.170
- Wow, this is so stunning
on you, oh my gosh.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.233
I wish I looked this
good at my prom, damn.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.188
- Well you look amazing.
- Thank you so much.

00:04:03.188 --> 00:04:05.010
- What person are you bring tonight to...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.110
- He's one of my close friends.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.131
- Oh, great, he's a good guy?

00:04:09.131 --> 00:04:10.290
- Yes he is.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.790
- Have you put in the right amount

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:13.720
of money for a background check?

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:14.800
- For a background check? (laughing)

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:15.987
- I know a good PI.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.313
- I think I chose him.

00:04:17.313 --> 00:04:19.300
- Good, good, good, but if
he gives you any trouble,

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.800
I recently took up kickboxing.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:21.663
- Oh, okay.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.380
Honestly, this whole experience
feels so, like, magical.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.770
Like, I never thought that I would

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.360
experience something like this.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.883
It just doesn't feel real, I
feel like a Disney princess.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:34.300
- I always say Instagram is not real life,

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.480
even though I try to share as
much of my true life as I can.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.660
Every image that you see
has been perfected, altered.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.840
Most girls in my position
want their photos to look

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.480
the best possible way they
can before they put them

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.480
in front of eight million people to see.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:51.070
So, young girls looking at
girls like me, just know that,

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:53.723
love yourself, embrace your flaws,

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.230
know who are, and just own it.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.680
- [Aria] Taking Abigail's words to heart,

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.500
despite feeling uncertain about it,

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.900
I decided to try posting
my first sincere attempt

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.323
at a serious photo later that day,

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:08.150
and as it turns out, in less than a week,

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:11.323
it's already become my
most liked photo ever.

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:13.810
While I don't know if this
means I'll eventually have

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:16.740
as many followers as
Abigail, I've definitely come

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.390
outta this with a lot more
respect for what she does.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.775
She's aware of the fact that, as she says,

00:05:21.775 --> 00:05:24.347
"Instagram is not real life."

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.130
And I do think that we have to realize

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.170
that while having followers and likes

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:31.483
may give us a fleeting
sense of satisfaction,

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.700
we ultimately shouldn't allow it

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:37.163
to determine our self
worth because it doesn't.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.820
Although, it would be nice to maybe have

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:42.383
as many followers as
Michael Buble someday,

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.770
just so we have something to talk about.

00:05:47.366 --> 00:05:50.033
(bells chiming)

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.360
If the guy gives you any trouble,

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.710
you take him like this, alright?

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.283
And that's, you're gonna,
it'll knock him out.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:01.153
You put enough pressure, he's done.

